\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Residual-based intercept correction on five synthetic observations. Observed targets and fixed baseline predictions determine residuals $r_i=y_i-2x_i=3$; their mean determines $b=3$. Adding $b$ reproduces the targets. The dashed path identifies reuse of the same five observations for correction and in-sample evaluation.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
